ight=111 /></span><br><br>- <strong>Competitive Leaderboards:</strong> Vie for the top spot on the Steam leaderboards, showcasing your skill as a master fruit merger.<br><br>- <strong>PvP Challenge:</strong> Engage in fruit-merging battles against other players. Out-merge your opponent within the time limit to push their playing field to the brink and secure your victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683210/extras/0d7117bb5b900e0e173eba23a256324d.poster.avif?t=1700503242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683210/extras/0d7117bb5b900e0e173eba23a256324d.webm?t=1700503242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683210/extras/0d7117bb5b900e0e173eba23a256324d.mp4?t=1700503242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Step into the vibrant world of &quot;Watermelon Challenge,&quot; where every successful merge celebrates the sweetness of strategy and the thrill of competition.<br><br>",
